# Git commits: no Cursor co-author

When creating git commits:

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any Cursor agent co-author trailer.
- Never use `git commit --trailer` to add Cursor as co-author.
- Commit messages should list only the human author unless the user explicitly names another co-author.
